v 3
d FEVC: module for leave-out bias-corrected variance decompositions
d
d fevc implements the Kline-Saggio-Solvsten leave-out bias correction
d for worker-firm fixed-effects models. It supports controls, weights,
d match or observation deletion, exact and randomized computation,
d numerical Monte Carlo standard errors, and supported projection
d and experimental component inference. Source-only Mata and an
d optional parallel Rust backend share one Stata interface.
d
d Version: 0.5.0
d Requires: Stata version 18
d SSC dependencies: none
d Distribution-Date: 20261015
d License: GPL-3.0-only
d Author: Johannes F. Schmieder, Boston University
d Support: email johannes@@bu.edu
d KW: variance components
d KW: fixed effects
d KW: leave-out estimation
d KW: limited mobility bias
d
